<title>GERMANY: Kohl says thinks Bonn will achieve growth forecast.</title>
<headline>Kohl says thinks Bonn will achieve growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl said on Friday that he expected Germany to reach its official growth forecast this year and continue to grow.</p>
<p>&quot;I assume that we will achieve our forecast of 2.5 pct and that a marked upturn will come,&quot; he told industrialists in Duesseldorf.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom +49 228 260 97150</p>
</text>
